<title>POLAND: Polish Stalprodukt IPO oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Polish Stalprodukt IPO oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:	     steel products maker Stalprodukt SA</p>
<p> Type of Issue:    common shares</p>
<p> Total No of Shares Offered:    1,200,000</p>
<p>Total No of Shares Subscribed: 1,679,045</p>
<p> Price (PLN)	 25</p>
<p>TRANCHES	 NO OF SHARES   NO OF SHARES     ORDERS</p>
<p>		   SUBSCRIBED     ALLOTED	    REDUCTION (PCT)</p>
<p>Institutional    823,605	778,600	    --</p>
<p>					 21,400	    52.4 *</p>
<p>Retail	     855,440	400,000	    53.2</p>
<p>NOTE: * Ten investors in the large investors tranche had preferences in taking the shares so their orders were not reduced. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
